# MasjidOS Pro (sibling plugin)

Path: `C:\Users\Manzur\Local Sites\powerup\app\public\wp-content\plugins\masjidos-pro`. Local **0.20.0**. Classes `MasjidOS_Pro_*`. Textdomain `masjidos-pro`. Details: Free repo `_future/project-memory.md` (Pro section).

Boot: `plugins_loaded:20` → needs `ITMMS_Core` + Free ≥ **1.2.0** → `MASJIDOS_PRO_ACTIVE`. Schema option `masjidos_pro_db_version` **1.13**.

## What Pro owns

Donations (pending→confirm, bKash/Nagad), Accounts (funds/ledger/budgets/month-lock), Collections (Jumuah/Eid/etc.), Members (families, dues, attendance, print card), Transparency report/PDF, Facilities booking, Madrasa + school fees + `/masjidos-teacher/`, Volunteers, premium widget designs, TV collections slide.

Admin = classic submenu pages under MasjidOS + `admin_post_masjidos_pro_*`. REST `masjidos-pro/v1` is donations/accounts/collections only.

Shortcodes: `masjidos_campaign`, `masjidos_donation_form`, `masjidos_financials`, `masjidos_transparency_report`, `masjidos_collections`, `masjidos_members`, `masjidos_facility_booking`, `masjidos_classes`, `masjidos_volunteers`.

Roles: `masjidos_treasurer`, `masjidos_accounts_viewer`, `masjidos_teacher`. Caps: `itmms_manage_donations|accounts|members`, `itmms_view_accounts`, `itmms_teach_classes`.

## Rules

- Implement Pro features in the Pro plugin. Hook Free filters; never patch Free for Pro behavior.
- New Pro shortcode → update `includes/class-pro-docs.php` (`masjidos_pro_docs`).
- License is a local stub (`masjidos_pro_license_key`). Designs unlock while Pro is active.
- Seeded restricted funds: zakat, sadaqah, lillah, fidya. Currency from Free settings.
- Public financial widgets need Free `public_transparency`. No Pro `uninstall.php` yet.
